b/ref 1071 "Consider the following matrices:\n\n$$\n{B}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}],\\,{B}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}],\\,A=[\\begin{aligned}-10 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 10\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nIf $B=\\{{B}_{1},{B}_{2}\\}$ is a basis of $\\text{Span}\\{{B}_{1},{B}_{2}\\},$ and $[A]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}],$ then ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559788 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "2ade0c9c-871d-5f78-8adc-bcd701d0727a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559788 #edb/ref 1074 "We need to find ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2}$ such that \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{B}_{1}+{x}_{2}{B}_{2}=A.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the given information into the above equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-10 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 10\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} & 2{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ 0 & 3{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-10 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 10\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding entries, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}=-10 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=0 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}=10.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThe equations above give a linear system with the augmented matrix\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & -10 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 10\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the matrix using Gaussian elimination, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M= & [\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & -10 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 10\\end{aligned}] &  & \\begin{aligned}{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\ {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+3{R}_{1}\\end{aligned} \\\\ ∼ & [\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & -10 \\\\ 0 & 5 & -20 \\\\ 0 & 5 & -20\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}=-10 \\\\ 5{x}_{2}=-20\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the second  equation, we get ${x}_{2}=-4.$ From the first equation, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2(-4) & =-10 \\\\ -{x}_{1} & =-2 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, $[A]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}].$\n\nFinally, ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=2+(-4)=-2.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186563976 #edb/ref 1080 "\\{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}<0\\}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186563976 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186563976 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0401f3db-693c-55a6-a2a6-cdcb8f618641" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564108 #edb/ref 1080 "\\{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}\\le 1\\}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564108 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564108 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "56d57d91-2728-51bc-b291-e2245cc07a65" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564254 #edb/ref 1080 "\\{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}>1\\}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564254 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564254 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "b88c88cc-ef4e-5607-aff6-aeedbfce6369" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564289 #edb/ref 1080 "\\{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}<1\\}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564289 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564289 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "cc963b79-b269-5331-848d-67f4ee353859" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564925 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186565490 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564925 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186565507 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564925 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186565523 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564925 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186565529 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564925 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186565531 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564925 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186565532 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564925 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186565534 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186564925 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045460 #edb/ref 1759